{"id":"d9b9ad74f5bc0aa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family.md","title":"ZFC Func Orthonormal Family","display":"df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family — ZFC Func Orthonormal Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family"],"display":"df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family — ZFC Func Orthonormal Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family — ZFC Func Orthonormal Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V\">\\(E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V\\)</span> (family, index set, vector-space data, and inner product)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (inner-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S(E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(E,I,H)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n(i=j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=1_k)\\land\n(i\\neq j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=0_k)\n\\Bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S(E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(E,I,H)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n(i=j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=1_k)\\land\n(i\\neq j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=0_k)\n\\Bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The field, addition, scalar action, and inner-product map are explicit parameters.  The inner product receives an ordered pair, as required by its upstream function signature, and the Kronecker-delta shorthand has been expanded into the diagonal and off-diagonal cases.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)$ (inner-product predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncOrthonormalFamily}_S(E,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(E,I,H)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n(i=j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=1_k)\\land\n(i\\neq j\\to B(\\langle E(i),E(j)\\rangle)=0_k)\n\\Bigr)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1443,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family.md|58-df-zfc-func-orthonormal-family]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","ce5a656462edb0c9"]}